 prediction of protein function</article-title><source>Mol Syst Biol</source><year>2007</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>88</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17353930</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/msb4100129</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yuryev</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Mulyukov</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Kotelnikova</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Maslov</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Egorov</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Nikitin</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Daraselia</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Mazo</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Automatic pathway building in biological association networks</article-title><source>BMC Bioinformatics</source><year>2006</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>171</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16563163</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1471-2105-7-171</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Malik</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Franke</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Siebes</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Combination of text-mining algorithms increases the performance</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><year>2006</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>2151</fpage><lpage>2157</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16766558</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/bioinformatics/btl281</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shatkay</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>H&#x000f6;glund</surnam